{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52529","headline":"望阙谢恩 · 陈元光","name":"望阙谢恩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御扆褒忠勇，官符再佩箴。\n遐陬蒙一体，服马赫遥临。\n海岭知天瑞，懽忻荷圣心。\n排衙香御胸，应郭撒妖祲。\n讲武勤西狩，呼嵩拜北钦。\n天颜严咫尺，夙夜敢荒淫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}